abstract: "Shared formal mathematics with separate fixed-ratio anisotropic, isotropic high-temperature and isotropic low-temperature manuscripts, theorem endpoints and verification procedures. ANISO: full odd/even expansions, every lattice site, all finite positive coupling ratios, explicit real-spin and Gibbs-field inputs, Lean C001. High-temperature: complete disordered-phase susceptibility, all odd orders, HT-1.0 / Lean 1747. Low-temperature: connected ordered pure-phase susceptibility, all even orders, manuscript v0.1-rc6 / Lean v0.3.0-rc2. Manuscripts and authored documentation use CC BY 4.0. Historical low-temperature citations and releases retain their original scope."
